                            "SQ_THREAD_TRACE_TOKEN_REG  :  Register write.  Use REG encoding. " = 0x2, 
                            "SQ_THREAD_TRACE_TOKEN_WAVE_START  :  Wave has started.  Use WAVE_START encoding. " = 0x3, 
                            "SQ_THREAD_TRACE_TOKEN_WAVE_ALLOC  :  Pixel shader color or vertex shader parameter output space has been allocated.  Use WAVE encoding.  Detail token: target compute unit only. " = 0x4, 
                            "SQ_THREAD_TRACE_TOKEN_REG_CSPRIV  :  There has been a compute pipeline private dat, state or threadgroup update.  Use REG_CS encoding. " = 0x5, 
                            "SQ_THREAD_TRACE_TOKEN_WAVE_END  :  Wave has completed.  Use WAVE encoding. " = 0x6, 
                            "SQ_THREAD_TRACE_TOKEN_EVENT  :  An event has reached the top of a shader stage.  In-order with WAVE_START.  Use EVENT encoding. " = 0x7, 
                            "SQ_THREAD_TRACE_TOKEN_EVENT_CS  :  An event has reached the top of a computer shader stage.  In-order with WAVE_START.  Use EVENT encoding. " = 0x8, 
                            "SQ_THREAD_TRACE_TOKEN_EVENT_GFX1  :  An event has reached the top of a shader stage for the second gfx pipe.  In-order with WAVE_START.  Use EVENT_DONE encoding. " = 0x9, 
                            "SQ_THREAD_TRACE_TOKEN_INST  :  The shader has executed an instruction.  Use INST encoding.  Detail token: target compute unit only. " = 0xa, 
                            "SQ_THREAD_TRACE_TOKEN_INST_PC  :  The shader has explicitly written the PC value.  Use INST_PC encoding.  Detail token: target compute unit only. " = 0xb, 
                            "SQ_THREAD_TRACE_TOKEN_INST_USERDATA  :  The shader has written some userdata into the thread trace buffer.  Use INST_USERDATA encoding. " = 0xc, 
                            "SQ_THREAD_TRACE_TOKEN_ISSUE  :  Information about instruction scheduling.  Use ISSUE encoding.  Detail token: target compute unit only. " = 0xd, 
                            "SQ_THREAD_TRACE_TOKEN_PERF  :  The performance counter delta has been updated.  PERF encoding. " = 0xe, 
