    MAJOR_MODE  3:2  ALPHA {"DI_MAJOR_MODE_0  :  DI_MAJOR_MODE_0 Normal (Implicit) Mode -- applies only to prim types 0-21. Some VGT state registers are ignored (their values implied) in this mode. " = 0x0, 
                            "DI_MAJOR_MODE_1  :  DI_MAJOR_MODE_1 DEPRECATED " = 0x1 }  ;
