                            "vgt_perf_VGT_PA_CLIPS_SEND  :  number of transfers sent across the CLIPS interface (S stands for state data and there's a transfer per draw packet) " = 0x2c, 
                            "vgt_perf_VGT_PA_CLIPS_STALLED  :  ready to send a CLIPS transfer, but stalled by the PA.  If there are stalls here it means the draw calls are really small. " = 0x2d, 
