                            "vgt_perf_vgt_spi_lsvert_eov  :  LS vert end of vector is active.  Sensitive to PERF_SEID_IGNORE_MASK " = 0x61, 
                            "vgt_perf_vgt_spi_lsvert_stalled  :  LS vert pipe is stalled.  Sensitive to PERF_SEID_IGNORE_MASK " = 0x62, 
