                            "vgt_perf_DS_CACHE_HITS  :  number of parameter cache hits due to a DS (hardware VS is a GS, so tessellation is enabled with GS disabled) " = 0x3e, 
                            "vgt_perf_TOTAL_CACHE_HITS  :  number of parameter cache hits regardless of the enabled stages.  Equals the sum of the 3 cache hit counters, VS, GS and DS. " = 0x3f, 
                            "vgt_perf_vgt_busy  :  Number of cycles VGT is busy " = 0x40, 
                            "vgt_perf_vgt_gs_busy  :  Number of cycles VGT GS block is busy " = 0x41, 
