                            "TCA_PERF_SEL_CROSSBAR_STALL_TCC0  :  Number of cycles no requests could be sent to TCC0 because its fifos were expected to be full.  The TCC number is based on the TCCs connected to this TCA and not on the global numbering. " = 0x1b, 
                            "TCA_PERF_SEL_CROSSBAR_STALL_TCC1" = 0x1c, 
