SQ_VOP3_0   <GpuF0Reg:0x8dfc> <GpuF1Reg:0x8dfc>   32    {
    VDST  7:0  ALPHA {"SQ_VGPR:  Vector GPR 0. Increment from here for additional GPRs. There are NUM_VGPR VGPRs in total. " = 0x0 }  ;
    ABS  10:8  NUM ;
    OP_SEL  14:11  NUM ;
    CLAMP  15:15  NUM ;
    OP  25:16  ALPHA {"SQ_V_OPC_OFFSET:  Offset to add to any VOPC opcodes when they need to use the VOP3 encoding. For example, SQ_V_OPC_OFFSET + SQ_V_CMP_EQ generates the VOP3 version of CMP_EQ. " = 0x0, 
                            "SQ_V_OP2_OFFSET:  Offset to add to any VOP2 opcodes when they need to use the VOP3 encoding. For example, SQ_V_OP2_OFFSET + SQ_V_ADD_F32 generates the VOP3 version of ADD. " = 0x100, 
                            "SQ_V_OP1_OFFSET:  Offset to add to any VOP1 opcodes when they need to use the VOP3 encoding. For example, SQ_V_OP1_OFFSET + SQ_V_MOV_B32 generates the VOP3 version of MOV. " = 0x140, 
                            "SQ_V_MAD_LEGACY_F32:  @code D.f = S0.f * S1.f + S2.f. // DX9 rules, 0.0 * x = 0.0 " = 0x1c0, 
                            "SQ_V_MAD_F32:   @code D.f = S0.f * S1.f + S2.f. @text 

1ULP accuracy, denormals are flushed.  " = 0x1c1, 
                            "SQ_V_MAD_I32_I24:  @code D.i = S0.i[23:0] * S1.i[23:0] + S2.i. " = 0x1c2, 
                            "SQ_V_MAD_U32_U24:  @code D.u = S0.u[23:0] * S1.u[23:0] + S2.u. " = 0x1c3, 
                            "SQ_V_CUBEID_F32:  D.f = cubemap face ID ({0.0, 1.0, ..., 5.0}). XYZ coordinate is given in (S0.f, S1.f, S2.f). " = 0x1c4, 
                            "SQ_V_CUBESC_F32:  D.f = cubemap S coordinate. XYZ coordinate is given in (S0.f, S1.f, S2.f). " = 0x1c5, 
                            "SQ_V_CUBETC_F32:  D.f = cubemap T coordinate. XYZ coordinate is given in (S0.f, S1.f, S2.f). " = 0x1c6, 
                            "SQ_V_CUBEMA_F32:  D.f = 2.0 * cubemap major axis. XYZ coordinate is given in (S0.f, S1.f, S2.f). " = 0x1c7, 
                            "SQ_V_BFE_U32:   @code D.u = (S0.u >> S1.u[4:0]) & ((1 << S2.u[4:0]) - 1). @text 

Bitfield extract with S0 = data, S1 = field_offset, S2 = field_width.  " = 0x1c8, 
                            "SQ_V_BFE_I32:   @code D.i = (S0.i >> S1.u[4:0]) & ((1 << S2.u[4:0]) - 1). @text 

Bitfield extract with S0 = data, S1 = field_offset, S2 = field_width.  " = 0x1c9, 
                            "SQ_V_BFI_B32:   @code D.u = (S0.u & S1.u) | (~S0.u & S2.u). @text 

Bitfield insert.  " = 0x1ca, 
                            "SQ_V_FMA_F32:   @code D.f = S0.f * S1.f + S2.f. @text 

Fused single precision multiply add. 0.5ULP accuracy, denormals are supported.  " = 0x1cb, 
                            "SQ_V_FMA_F64:   @code D.d = S0.d * S1.d + S2.d. @text 

Fused double precision multiply add. 0.5ULP precision, denormals are supported.  " = 0x1cc, 
                            "SQ_V_LERP_U8:   @code D.u = ((S0.u[31:24] + S1.u[31:24] + S2.u[24]) >> 1) << 24
 D.u += ((S0.u[23:16] + S1.u[23:16] + S2.u[16]) >> 1) << 16;
 D.u += ((S0.u[15:8] + S1.u[15:8] + S2.u[8]) >> 1) << 8;
 D.u += ((S0.u[7:0] + S1.u[7:0] + S2.u[0]) >> 1). @text 

Unsigned 8-bit pixel average on packed unsigned bytes (linear interpolation). S2 acts as a round mode; if set, 0.5 rounds up, otherwise 0.5 truncates.  " = 0x1cd, 
                            "SQ_V_ALIGNBIT_B32:  @code D.u = ({S0,S1} >> S2.u[4:0]) & 0xffffffff. " = 0x1ce, 
                            "SQ_V_ALIGNBYTE_B32:  @code D.u = ({S0,S1} >> (8*S2.u[4:0])) & 0xffffffff. " = 0x1cf, 
                            "SQ_V_MIN3_F32:  @code D.f = V_MIN_F32(V_MIN_F32(S0.f, S1.f), S2.f). " = 0x1d0, 
                            "SQ_V_MIN3_I32:  @code D.i = V_MIN_I32(V_MIN_I32(S0.i, S1.i), S2.i). " = 0x1d1, 
