PA_SC_PERFCOUNTER5_SELECT   <GpuF0Reg:0x36518> <GpuF1Reg:0x36518>   32    {
    PERF_SEL  9:0  ALPHA {"SC_SRPS_WINDOW_VALID  :  SC_SRPS_WINDOW_VALID              Counts PERFCOUNTER_START to PERFCOUNTER_STOP stop perfcounter enable window for specific points in the SC pipeline. Number of clocks event-window is valid ;
Where measured:  at stage register/primitive setup bottom (below pbb if present at push into sc_ps_eng);
increment rate-one per clock ;
range-1/clk;
CONTEXT_STATE_SENSITIVE=NO;
Results reported per SE and INSTANCE_INDEX 0 to num_packer_per_sc-1, Data valid for INSTANCE_INDEX=0 only
 " = 0x0, 
                            "SC_PSSW_WINDOW_VALID  :  SC_PSSW_WINDOW_VALID              Number of clocks event-window is valid at primitive setup/supertile walker ;
