 " = 0xc, 
                            "SC_STARVED_BY_DB_TILE  :  SC_STARVED_BY_DB_TILE             sc starved by db tile. SC is waiting for tiles back from the db. This will always be the case for the first few transactions (repeater delays + db transaction latency). (Non-harvestable) ;
Where measured: SC internal tile fifo(s) not empty. ;
increment rate 1 per clock ;
range-1/clk ;
CONTEXT_STATE_SENSITIVE=NO;
Results reported per SE and INSTANCE_INDEX 0 to num_packer_per_sc-1
 " = 0xd, 
                            "SC_STALLED_BY_TILEORDERFIFO  :  SC_STALLED_BY_TILEORDERFIFO       sc stalled by tile order fifo. Only applicable to variants with 2 RB's per packer. ;
