 " = 0xf, 
                            "SC_STALLED_BY_DB_QUAD  :  SC_STALLED_BY_DB_QUAD             sc stalled by SC to DB quad processor interface fifo full (credits PA_SC_IF_FIFO_SIZE_SC_DB_QUAD_IF_FIFO_SIZE). (Non Harvestable) ;
