 " = 0x10, 
                            "SC_STARVED_BY_DB_QUAD  :  SC_STARVED_BY_DB_QUAD             sc starved by db quad tilaccum (quadaccum if 1RB/packer) has quad entries, but no quads are being received back from the DB (Non harvestable);
