                            "RMI_PERF_SEL_DEMUX_TCIW_RESIDENCY_NACK1  :  DEMUX to TCIW residency(mask=0, rd+wr) check with NACK=1. (VMID from reg., internal precoding on VMID) " = 0xbc, 
